 says to check the name against the day's expected-visitor list when issuing a badge.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Print a badge from the front desk terminal.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source states badges are printed from the front desk terminal.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"host's name on the badge in the space provided\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source instructs writing the host's name on the badge in the space provided.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"visitor to wear it above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source says the visitor is asked to wear the badge above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The returning section instructs wiping the badge with the cleaning cloth.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source states the cleaning cloth is kept in the top drawer.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"put it back in the return tray\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source says the badge is wiped and then put back in the return tray.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source gives this instruction under the unreturned badge section.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"send the list of unreturned badges to the security office\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source says the list of unreturned badges is sent to the security office at the end of the day.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source states badges missing for 7 days are deactivated.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states such badges go to the security office rather than back into the return tray.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The security office decides whether to\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states the security office decides whether to reactivate the late-returned badge.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states contractors on multi-day jobs get a week badge instead of a day badge.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states the week badge validity in the same terms.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\",\"evi